# Same secret rules as .gitignore: .env never enters a build context.
# Patterns are anchored at the context root, hence the **/ prefixes.
# Every build context (e.g. web/) needs its own copy of the secret rules.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key

.git
.omc
.claude
ai-sessions
**/Smart Campaign Composer Case.html

bin
**/coverage.*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/pgdata
**/*.log
